<%# The runner no longer has this run.

    Its state lives in memory, so restarting the service forgets every run it
    started. Nothing is lost — the results are on disk and the row is in this
    database once published — but the live half of this page has nothing left to
    report, and saying so beats a frame that fails to load. %>
<%= turbo_frame_tag "run-status" do %>
  <p class="muted">
    The runner no longer has this run — it forgets them when it restarts.
    <%= link_to "Reload", run_path(stamp) %> once the results have been saved.
  </p>
<% end %>
